OST（提交数据,登陆注册常用这种方式）</span></li></ul><h4 data-lake-id=\"toc-8a79fcf4ffc4e297ff63dc1df523d19f\" id=\"toc-8a79fcf4ffc4e297ff63dc1df523d19f\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><u><span data-lake-id=\"uaa6cd250\" id=\"uaa6cd250\">requests 模块安装</span></u></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u4684d487\" id=\"u4684d487\"><span data-lake-id=\"u38de7c42\" id=\"u38de7c42\">通过 pip 命令安装：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22pip%20install%20requests%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VFyQi%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h4 data-lake-id=\"toc-e0286134970aebdf8d7745a1f1ad4583\" id=\"toc-e0286134970aebdf8d7745a1f1ad4583\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubfb12232\" id=\"ubfb12232\"> GET 请求</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u01a5b2ef\" id=\"u01a5b2ef\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc497b7bc\" id=\"uc497b7bc\">场景</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u27f8058f\" id=\"u27f8058f\">：获取豆瓣电影 Top250 榜单数据（公开 API：https://api.douban.com/v2/movie/top250）。<br /></span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue8e19aab\" id=\"ue8e19aab\">步骤</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u83c6a77d\" id=\"u83c6a77d\">：</span></p><ul list=\"ua1b6068e\"><li fid=\"u6db955e9\" data-lake-id=\"ud7b4cc7a\" id=\"ud7b4cc7a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u15e0af95\" id=\"u15e0af95\">基础请求</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u592728d4\" id=\"u592728d4\">：</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20requests%5Cn%5Cnurl%20%3D%20%5C%22http%3A%2F%2Fhttpbin.org%2Fget%5C%22%5Cnresponse%20%3D%20